Package: ggrateful
Type: Package
Title: Grateful Dead Album Color Palettes for ggplot2
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Josh Carrell
Maintainer: Josh Carrell <joshdcarrell@gmail.com>
Description: Provides discrete and continuous color palettes derived from
    Grateful Dead album covers and tour art, along with scale functions
    for use with ggplot2. Includes both fill and color scale variants,
    a display function for previewing palettes, and continuous gradient
    versions of select palettes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    scales
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
